.TP
.B supported_image_types = []
The list of MIME types of image formats supported by the builder.
Image files are searched in the order in which they appear here.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Added in version 1.2.

.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B class sphinx.builders.xml.PseudoXMLBuilder
This builder is used for debugging the Sphinx/Docutils \(dqReader to Transform
to Writer\(dq pipeline. It produces compact pretty\-printed \(dqpseudo\-XML\(dq, files
where nesting is indicated by indentation (no end\-tags). External
attributes for all elements are output, and internal attributes for any
leftover \(dqpending\(dq elements are also given.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
