Parse the directive\(aqs content into nodes.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Parameters
\fBallow_section_headings\fP \-\- Are titles (sections) allowed in the directive\(aqs content?
Note that this option bypasses Docutils\(aq usual checks on
doctree structure, and misuse of this option can lead to
an incoherent doctree. In Docutils, section nodes should
only be children of \fBStructural\fP nodes, which includes
\fBdocument\fP, \fBsection\fP, and \fBsidebar\fP nodes.
