.B class sphinx.util.docutils.ReferenceRole
A base class for reference roles.
.sp
The reference roles can accept \fBlink title <target>\fP style as a text for
the role.  The parsed result; link title and target will be stored to
\fBself.title\fP and \fBself.target\fP\&.
.sp
Added in version 2.0.

.INDENT 7.0
.TP
