.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
#13012: Expose \fBsphinx.errors.ExtensionError\fP \%<#\:sphinx\:.errors\:.ExtensionError> in \fBsphinx.util\fP
for backwards compatibility.
This will be removed in Sphinx 9, as exposing the exception
in \fBsphinx.util\fP was never intentional.
\fBExtensionError\fP has been part of \fBsphinx.errors\fP since Sphinx 0.9.
Patch by Adam Turner.
