.SS Incompatible changes
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
#12763: Remove unused internal class \fBsphinx.util.Tee\fP\&.
Patch by Adam Turner.
.IP \(bu 2
#12822: LaTeX: for Unicode engines, the \(aqfvset\(aq \%<#\:fvset> default is changed to
\fB\(aq\e\efvset{fontsize=auto}\(aq\fP from \fB\(aq\e\efvset{fontsize=\e\esmall}\(aq\fP\&.
Code\-blocks are unchanged as FreeMono is now loaded with \fBScale=0.9\fP\&.
An adjustment to existing projects is needed only if they used a custom
\(aqfontpkg\(aq \%<#\:fontpkg> configuration and did not set \(aqfvset\(aq \%<#\:fvset>\&.
Patch by Jean\-François B.
.IP \(bu 2
#12875: Disable smartquotes for languages: \fBzh_CN\fP and \fBzh_TW\fP by default.
Patch by A. Rafey Khan.
