.IP \(bu 2
#12630: Sphinx 8 makes two changes to the \fBlinkcheck\fP configuration defaults:
.INDENT 2.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBlinkcheck_allow_unauthorized\fP \%<#\:confval-linkcheck_allow_unauthorized> is now \fBFalse\fP by default.
.IP \(bu 2
