#9097: Optimize the parallel build
.IP \(bu 2
#9131: Add \fBnitpick_ignore_regex\fP \%<#\:confval-nitpick_ignore_regex> to ignore nitpicky warnings using
regular expressions
.IP \(bu 2
#9174: Add \fBSphinx.set_html_assets_policy\fP to tell extensions to include
HTML assets in all the pages. Extensions can check this via
\fBSphinx.registry.html_assets_policy\fP
.IP \(bu 2
C++, add support for
.INDENT 2.0
