3.0.0b1
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
LaTeX: drop dependency on \fBextractbb\fP for image inclusion in
Japanese documents as \fB\&.xbb\fP files are unneeded by \fBdvipdfmx\fP
since TeXLive2015 (refs: #6189)
