#5249: LaTeX: Unicode Greek letters in math directive break PDF build
(fix requires extra set\-up, see \fBlatex_elements\fP \%<#\:confval-latex_elements> \fB\(aqtextgreek\(aq\fP key
and/or \fBlatex_engine\fP \%<#\:confval-latex_engine> setting)
.IP \(bu 2
#5772: LaTeX: should the Bjarne style of fncychap be used for English also
if passed as language option?
.IP \(bu 2
#5179: LaTeX: (lualatex only) escaping of \fB>\fP by \fB\etextgreater{}\fP is not
