.SS Release 1.8.1 (released Sep 22, 2018)
.SS Incompatible changes
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
LaTeX \fB\epagestyle\fP commands have been moved to the LaTeX template. No
changes in PDF, except possibly if \fB\esphinxtableofcontents\fP, which
contained them, had been customized in \fBconf.py\fP\&. (refs: #5455)
.UNINDENT
.SS Bugs fixed
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
