.IP \(bu 2
#1444: autosummary does not create the description from attributes docstring.
.IP \(bu 2
#1457: In python3 environment, make linkcheck cause \(dqCan\(aqt convert \(aqbytes\(aq
object to str implicitly\(dq error when link target url has a hash part.
Thanks to Jorge_C.
.IP \(bu 2
#1467: Exception on Python3 if nonexistent method is specified by automethod
